WEBVTT

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:00.280
Pa kalnu ceļiem,

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.000
dienu un nakti,

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:06.030
un pat pa līkumaino Lombardas ielu

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.570
Sanfrancisko.

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:09.000
(Smiekli)

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:13.000
Dažreiz mūsu mašīna uzvedas tik traki,

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.000
ka veic nelielus trikus.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.000
(Video) Vīrietis: Ak, Dievs!

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.790
Ko?

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.000
Otrs vīrietis: Tas brauc pats no sevis.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:30.920
Sebastiāns Truns: Es gan nevaru 
atgriezt dzīvē savu draugu Haroldu,